    <string name="help_topic_1_title">1. How to record first purchase?</string>
    <string name="help_topic_1_desc">Tap \'Buy Items\' on Home screen. Choose category, enter Model &amp; IMEI, add Seller detail and payment info, then tap Save.</string>
    <string name="help_topic_2_title">2. How to sell an item?</string>
    <string name="help_topic_2_desc">Tap \'Sell Items\' on Home screen. Select phone from stock, enter Customer detail, sale price, and received amount, then tap Save.</string>
    <string name="help_topic_3_title">3. How to record partial (udhaar) payments?</string>
    <string name="help_topic_3_desc">When buying or selling with partial payment, the remaining balance is calculated automatically. Set a promised return date in the wizard.</string>
    <string name="help_topic_4_title">4. How to collect customer dues later?</string>
    <string name="help_topic_4_desc">Go to Home -&gt; \'Khata / Ledger\'. Tap customer\'s name, then tap \'Receive Payment\' button to record received cash.</string>
    <string name="help_topic_5_title">5. How to process phone exchange?</string>
    <string name="help_topic_5_desc">Tap \'Exchange\' on Home. Enter purchase details of old item and sale details of new item on a single unified screen.</string>
    <string name="help_topic_6_title">6. How to invite staff members?</string>
    <string name="help_topic_6_desc">Go to Settings -&gt; Team -&gt; \'Copy Invite Code\' and send code to staff via WhatsApp. Staff member enters code during app setup to join.</string>
    <string name="help_topic_7_title">7. Where to view profit (Owner)?</string>
    <string name="help_topic_7_desc">Tap Dashboard icon next to Settings on Home top bar. View monthly net profit and analytics card.</string>
    <string name="dashboard_help_today_sales_title">What are Today\'s Sales?</string>
    <string name="dashboard_help_today_sales_msg">Total sum of all device sales recorded since midnight today.</string>
    <string name="dashboard_help_profit_title">How is Monthly Profit calculated?</string>
    <string name="dashboard_help_profit_msg">Total Sales this month minus Purchase Cost of items sold minus Shop Expenses (Rent, Electricity, Maintenance).</string>
    <string name="dashboard_help_capital_title">What is Capital in Stock?</string>
    <string name="dashboard_help_capital_msg">Total purchase value of all unsold inventory currently available in your shop stock.</string>
    <string name="dashboard_help_slow_stock_title">What is Slow Stock?</string>
    <string name="dashboard_help_slow_stock_msg">Mobile phones that have remained unsold in shop stock for more than 30 days.</string>
